#     Surface Boundary Extraction Fields
#     nml_fieldsSurf : field names for surface ocean state/flux variables for
#                      each open boundary (e.g. XXXXXX)
#
#     Output Options:
#     nml_filePrec : output file real precision (32 or 64 bits)
#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

